COMPLIANCE:
Scene ID: SC_007_002
Allowed events: Foyer locks down, regenerating guards attack, lethal compliance grids activate, Rhea sacrifices junk data, Obsidian Shard is partially consumed but retained, path to inner sanctum opens.
Forbidden milestones: sanctum_threshold_reached = DONE
